      "text": "CIRCUIT BREAKER STATES (Hystrix)\nCLOSED  ->  requests flow normally, error rate < 50%\nOPEN    ->  errors > 50% in 10s window; fast-fail for 5s, return fallback\nHALF-OPEN ->  1 test request; if success -> CLOSED, else -> OPEN",
      "originalText": "CIRCUIT BREAKER STATES (Hystrix)\nCLOSED  ->  requests flow normally, error rate < 50%\nOPEN    ->  errors > 50% in 10s window; fast-fail for 5s, return fallback\nHALF-OPEN ->  1 test request; if success -> CLOSED, else -> OPEN",
